WEBVTT

00:01:30.058 --> 00:01:34.519
This time, the man doesn't 
touch the money.

00:01:34.519 --> 00:01:38.990
"Where are you from?" he asks.

00:01:38.990 --> 00:01:44.192
"Excuse me?" Raisuddin answers.

00:01:44.192 --> 00:01:48.317
His accent betrays him.

00:01:48.317 --> 00:01:53.334
The tattooed man, a self-styled
true American vigilante,

00:01:53.334 --> 00:01:58.083
shoots Raisuddin in revenge for 9/11.

00:01:58.083 --> 00:02:02.732
Raisuddin feels millions of bees
stinging his face.